[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21200900_02_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21200900_02_0010","text":"凛世\n那套服装，果然很适合你"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21200900_02_0020","text":"谢谢您……\n凛世也……很喜欢……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21200900_02_0030","text":"那就好\n看到现在的凛世，大家的心都会被夺走吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21200900_02_0040","text":"被夺走……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21200900_02_0050","text":"嗯，粉丝们的心啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21200900_02_0060","text":"……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21200900_02_0070","text":"凛世……──\n凛世……想夺走的……──"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21200900_02_0080","text":"嗯……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21200900_02_0090","text":"没、没有…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21200900_02_0100","text":"我会去夺来的……\n大家……的心……"}]
